ATP fixture for VMC-ATP-027, VMC-ATP-036. Test instrumentation, not part of the product.

Supplies a custom WorldGenerator through ServerConfigBuilder::world_generator:
  - surface (top block) at Y=79, so players stand at Y=80; stone below;
  - top block gold where world X mod 8 is 0-3, grass where it is 4-7 (stripes along Z);
  - logs "ATP generator chunk chunk=<x>,<z>" for every chunk it generates.
Adds the voidmc-protocol dependency the trait's return type needs.
Use it with an empty world directory: stored chunks are loaded instead of generated.

Apply at the repository root:   git apply tools/atp/patches/<this file>
Remove it after the test:       git apply -R tools/atp/patches/<this file>

